ur]]\n*3 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*3 cups [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*1 cup [[Cookbook:Yogurt|yogurt]]\n*1 glass [[Cookbook:Water|mineral water]]\n*1 big slice [[Cookbook:Cheese|cheese]], crushed\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Mix everything together to make a batter.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] the batter in a 5 cm deep greased [[Cookbook:Baking Pan|pan]] until golden.\n# Serve with ''kiseli kupus'' and ''pavlaka''.\n\n[[Category:Serbian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cornbread]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Proja (Serbian Cornbread)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 cups cornmeal","sourceText":"5 cups cornmeal","amountText":"5 cups cornmeal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 cups flour","sourceText":"3 cups flour","amountText":"3 cups flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 eggs","sourceText":"3 eggs","amountText":"3 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 cups oil","sourceText":"3 cups oil","amountText":"3 cups oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 baking powder","sourceText":"1 baking powder","amountText":"1 baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 cup yogurt","sourceText":"1 cup yogurt","amountText":"1 cup yogurt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 glass mineral water","sourceText":"1 glass mineral water","amountText":"1 glass mineral water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 big slice cheese, crushed","source